{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"向量场的流"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"向量场的流"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>若将向量场视为自同胚群的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Lie代数","text":"Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"的元素, 则向量场的流是这个 Lie 代数到 “Lie 群” 的"},{"Local":{"url":"指数映射(Lie群)","text":"指数映射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}